    "body": "## Summary\n- require device-reported GPS accuracy for live courier samples\n- reject fixes worse than configurable `TRACKING_MAX_ACCURACY_METERS` (default 150 m) before persisting position or refreshing ETA\n- keep the existing implied-speed guard and accuracy allowance for accepted samples\n- expose the threshold in application/Docker environment configuration\n- add focused unit coverage for missing, excessive and boundary accuracy values\n- update live-tracking integrity/privacy documentation\n\n## Validation\n- branch is a single commit directly on current `master` (`c535bf0`)\n- diff reviewed: 6 files, no Flyway migration required because the persisted model is unchanged\n- local execution is unavailable in this automation environment because outbound DNS to GitHub is blocked; GitHub checks should be treated as the merge gate\n\nDo not merge unless available CI/checks pass.",
