      "message": "tracking: reject unusable GPS fixes\n\nRequire reported GPS accuracy and reject samples outside a configurable 150 m default quality threshold before they can replace the live courier position or trigger ETA work. Expose the threshold through runtime configuration, cover missing/excessive/boundary accuracy with unit tests, and document the tracking integrity/privacy invariant.",
